{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19150","headline":"和宣武令狐相公郡斋对新竹 · 刘禹锡","name":"和宣武令狐相公郡斋对新竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新竹翛翛韵晓风，隔囱依砌尚蒙笼。\n数间素壁初开後，一段清光入坐中。\n欹枕闲看知自适，含毫朗咏与谁同。\n此君若欲长相见，政事堂东有旧丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}